==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[diagonal]] [[element]]}}

# {{lb|en|linear algebra}} An element on the [[main diagonal]] of a [[square matrix]], that is, an element in row ''k'' and column ''k'' where ''k'' is an integer between 1 and the number of rows (or columns) in the matrix.

